## Interface: 30300
## Title: Uncapped Quests (giver data)
## Notes: Generated quest-giver table. Loaded on demand by Uncapped Quests; not at login.
## Author: Uncapped
## Version: 1.2.0
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## DefaultState: Enabled

# [MQ-05] LoadOnDemand is the whole point of this addon existing. 640 KB of
# generated table used to sit at the top of UncappedQuests.toc and was therefore
# parsed by every player at every login and every /reload, for a feature that is
# opt-in and default OFF. It is pulled in by UQ.EnsureQuestData() on first use.
#
# /!\ DefaultState: Enabled is LOAD-BEARING. A LoadOnDemand addon that is
#     DISABLED in the character's addon list cannot be loaded by LoadAddOn() at
#     all -- it returns nil, "DISABLED" -- and the pick-up arrow would then
#     silently find nothing. It must also be listed in the launcher manifest's
#     forceEnableAddOns for the same reason.

UncappedQuestGiverData.lua
